(3147123, 442010, 67841, '<td valign="top">You went a little overboard on the sharpening/USM - remember that it can''t make up for bad focus (I often have to tell myself that!) | B&amp;W may have worked better here | A little vignetting would have helped focus the viewers attention | Lighting would have been nicer if the key was brought around 180 degrees &amp; a light fill added where the main light source is right now (I know, you probably didn''t have control over where the light was, but you could have moved the bag to coordinate with the light or used a trouble light --  anything!) |  Perspective is flat, coming around &amp; placing the camera so we were looking around it slightly would have brought more drama to the image.<br/> <br/>&lt;&lt; 4 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'You went a little overboard on the sharpening/USM - remember that it can''t make up for bad focus (I often have to tell myself that!) | B&W may have worked better here | A little vignetting would have helped focus the viewers attention | Lighting would have been nicer if the key was brought around 180 degrees & a light fill added where the main light source is right now (I know, you probably didn''t have control over where the light was, but you could have moved the bag to coordinate with the light or used a trouble light --  anything!) |  Perspective is flat, coming around & placing the camera so we were looking around it slightly would have brought more drama to the image. << 4 >>', '2006-12-25 01:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3147124, 440838, 65025, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting...I love the contrast between the cool and warm colors.</td>', 'Awesome lighting...I love the contrast between the cool and warm colors.', '2006-12-25 01:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3147125, 441787, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.</td>', 'Nice perspective.', '2006-12-25 01:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
