(3147137, 441379, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice camera!<br/> <br/>Were a bit flat here lighting-wise, IMHO.  Your key (a window?) is to low/you''re too high &amp; your fill light/hair light to far behind to really bring texture the subject.<br/> <br/>Background is obviously (deliberately?) flat, which doesn''t help as it does nothing to reinforce the look on the subjects face.   Expression seems unmotivated for the environment  -  you are asking too much of the viewer!<br/> <br/>&lt;&lt; 5 &gt;&gt;<br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Nice camera! Were a bit flat here lighting-wise, IMHO.  Your key (a window?) is to low/you''re too high & your fill light/hair light to far behind to really bring texture the subject. Background is obviously (deliberately?) flat, which doesn''t help as it does nothing to reinforce the look on the subjects face.   Expression seems unmotivated for the environment  -  you are asking too much of the viewer! << 5 >> Good luck!', '2006-12-25 01:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
