(3148483, 442019, 6519, '<td valign="top">I can''t make up my mind about this one. The concept of the photo - as it relates to the challenge - is both a unique and clever take on it, as well as a total cop-out  :-) <br/>Since I can''t decide, I''ll just judge it by the merit of the photo itself.</td>', 'I can''t make up my mind about this one. The concept of the photo - as it relates to the challenge - is both a unique and clever take on it, as well as a total cop-out  :-) Since I can''t decide, I''ll just judge it by the merit of the photo itself.', '2006-12-25 19:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3148488, 440634, 6519, '<td valign="top">Some suggestions for this one:<br/>1) level your horizon<br/>2) turn off your date stamp (those things get you DQ''ed, I''m surprised that hasn''t happened yet)<br/>3) I am guessing that the haze was caused by sunlight hitting the lens. A lens  hood would have avoided it, but a little tweak in curves does wonders for this photo after the fact.<br/>4) If you had positioned yourself so that you created some diagonals, you might have ended up with a stronger composition.</td>', 'Some suggestions for this one:1) level your horizon2) turn off your date stamp (those things get you DQ''ed, I''m surprised that hasn''t happened yet)3) I am guessing that the haze was caused by sunlight hitting the lens. A lens  hood would have avoided it, but a little tweak in curves does wonders for this photo after the fact.4) If you had positioned yourself so that you created some diagonals, you might have ended up with a stronger composition.', '2006-12-25 19:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3148490, 442184, 6519, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for this type of post processing, but at least this particular photo is suited for it.</td>', 'I don''t care for this type of post processing, but at least this particular photo is suited for it.', '2006-12-25 19:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3148491, 440171, 6519, '<td valign="top">You have a very interesting subject here. Better lighting (and probably a slightly different angle) would have improved your photo.</td>', 'You have a very interesting subject here. Better lighting (and probably a slightly different angle) would have improved your photo.', '2006-12-25 19:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3148493, 442269, 6519, '<td valign="top">What a magical shot. I keep playing with curves and levels, and each different look that achieves has its own merits. One of my two favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'What a magical shot. I keep playing with curves and levels, and each different look that achieves has its own merits. One of my two favorites in this challenge.', '2006-12-25 19:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3148502, 441811, 6519, '<td valign="top">I am probably repeating what 10 others have already said, but here goes anyway:<br/>I like your idea and interpretation, but don''t care for the full-on flash look.<br/>      Try bouncing it, using additional lights, reflectors, etc.... anything to soften those shadows. Then step away from the wall a bit more and presto... an improved photo.</td>', 'I am probably repeating what 10 others have already said, but here goes anyway:I like your idea and interpretation, but don''t care for the full-on flash look.      Try bouncing it, using additional lights, reflectors, etc.... anything to soften those shadows. Then step away from the wall a bit more and presto... an improved photo.', '2006-12-25 20:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3148505, 441484, 6519, '<td valign="top">Very nice, classic portrait. Great light and choice of color combinations. The wrinkles (in the background) are bugging me, but perhaps that''s just me  :-)  7</td>', 'Very nice, classic portrait. Great light and choice of color combinations. The wrinkles (in the background) are bugging me, but perhaps that''s just me  :-)  7', '2006-12-25 20:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3148509, 441883, 6519, '<td valign="top">The one and only connection to the challenge is the title. Otherwise a good shot.</td>', 'The one and only connection to the challenge is the title. Otherwise a good shot.', '2006-12-25 20:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3148513, 442140, 6519, '<td valign="top">Personally I''d prefer it a little less "high key", but I love how you combined a wonderfully emotional portrait with the occupation part.</td>', 'Personally I''d prefer it a little less "high key", but I love how you combined a wonderfully emotional portrait with the occupation part.', '2006-12-25 20:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
