(3151012, 440985, 16197, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting, and this almost worked really well overall.  Yet, I think the main figure is too far and I would have really liked to see the lighting effects better.  I had to look for an extra second to reliece that I am at the ground in front of the forks.  Nice concept, however, just needs for me a little extra push.</td>', 'I love the lighting, and this almost worked really well overall.  Yet, I think the main figure is too far and I would have really liked to see the lighting effects better.  I had to look for an extra second to reliece that I am at the ground in front of the forks.  Nice concept, however, just needs for me a little extra push.', '2006-12-26 23:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3151017, 441495, 16197, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I like the camera angle for the keyboard, but it is hard to make out all three screens.  I am also wondering about the blur of the hand.  I am sure that was done on purpose. yet, it throws me off because of the sheer size.  Maybe if the hand itself was still and only the fingers were blured?  That might create a more dramatic effect.  Also, with the screens closer together.</td>', 'Hmm, I like the camera angle for the keyboard, but it is hard to make out all three screens.  I am also wondering about the blur of the hand.  I am sure that was done on purpose. yet, it throws me off because of the sheer size.  Maybe if the hand itself was still and only the fingers were blured?  That might create a more dramatic effect.  Also, with the screens closer together.', '2006-12-26 23:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3151019, 441358, 60505, '<td valign="top">gorgeous, but not exctly to theme. 10 for the photo, but not for the theme</td>', 'gorgeous, but not exctly to theme. 10 for the photo, but not for the theme', '2006-12-26 23:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3151021, 441787, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is really great texture shot.  I could see useing this for a great many effects.  However, I only have to ''assume'' you may be a brick layer? It does not tell me your occupation, or what you may spend a lot of time doing.  From just the image, its a brick.</td>', 'This is really great texture shot.  I could see useing this for a great many effects.  However, I only have to ''assume'' you may be a brick layer? It does not tell me your occupation, or what you may spend a lot of time doing.  From just the image, its a brick.', '2006-12-26 23:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3151025, 442264, 60505, '<td valign="top">great shot, good composition. lighting too harsh, would like to have seen more of any star. maybe some more accent on the trigger!?</td>', 'great shot, good composition. lighting too harsh, would like to have seen more of any star. maybe some more accent on the trigger!?', '2006-12-26 23:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3151026, 442160, 16197, '<td valign="top">This gave me a great feeling of space when I first saw it.  Space shuttle stuff. than I relized it was a dryer.  I like the concept of the two together, However, I don''t care for the gamera totaly hiding your face.</td>', 'This gave me a great feeling of space when I first saw it.  Space shuttle stuff. than I relized it was a dryer.  I like the concept of the two together, However, I don''t care for the gamera totaly hiding your face.', '2006-12-26 23:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3151029, 442269, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very wonderful image.  This is the stuff dreams are made of.  The peace and mystery.  Yet, last I knew farming was some serious back breaking work.. Still a very nice image.</td>', 'Very wonderful image.  This is the stuff dreams are made of.  The peace and mystery.  Yet, last I knew farming was some serious back breaking work.. Still a very nice image.', '2006-12-26 23:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3151032, 441398, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the image, but I don''t understand your message.  The black border itself is distracting, the straigh clean nices mixed with the soft blured black  just doesn''t hold very strong with me.  But least it makes me laugh.</td>', 'I enjoy the image, but I don''t understand your message.  The black border itself is distracting, the straigh clean nices mixed with the soft blured black  just doesn''t hold very strong with me.  But least it makes me laugh.', '2006-12-26 23:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3151033, 440838, 60505, '<td valign="top">really great photo, orange and blue color contrasts very nice. good light balancing act!would have tried to loose the arms uptop with black drapes or something, as these are the only other distractions in an otherwise very good pic</td>', 'really great photo, orange and blue color contrasts very nice. good light balancing act!would have tried to loose the arms uptop with black drapes or something, as these are the only other distractions in an otherwise very good pic', '2006-12-26 23:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3151037, 442311, 16197, '<td valign="top">It is an alright image.  I am really looking to figure out what it is. and I think I am coming to the conclusion that it is a tattoo machine.  Which, goes with your title.  Ink into flesh?, Anyway, it is a decent image, but not strong enough for me.  Maybe that red light just washes out the machine to much.</td>', 'It is an alright image.  I am really looking to figure out what it is. and I think I am coming to the conclusion that it is a tattoo machine.  Which, goes with your title.  Ink into flesh?, Anyway, it is a decent image, but not strong enough for me.  Maybe that red light just washes out the machine to much.', '2006-12-26 23:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3151038, 441620, 60505, '<td valign="top">very nice. I could have tolerated a little more light on the face, or at least on the near eye.</td>', 'very nice. I could have tolerated a little more light on the face, or at least on the near eye.', '2006-12-26 23:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3151040, 441008, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a cute idea.  yet, for me, it is not sharp enough.  The camera looks slighly blured.  Also, I think I would have liked a cleaner look at the view finder.</td>', 'This is a cute idea.  yet, for me, it is not sharp enough.  The camera looks slighly blured.  Also, I think I would have liked a cleaner look at the view finder.', '2006-12-26 23:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
