(3153277, 442311, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition, nicely lit, good focus, and nice colors. But hard as I try, I don''t understand what occupation this represents. Is this some sort of photography equipment that I am not advanced enough to be familiar with? 8</td>', 'This is a nice composition, nicely lit, good focus, and nice colors. But hard as I try, I don''t understand what occupation this represents. Is this some sort of photography equipment that I am not advanced enough to be familiar with? 8', '2006-12-27 11:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
