(3155790, 440969, 46314, '<td valign="top">Has a snapshot quality. Needed something to make it more dramatic - maybe you could have used the paints more expressively, or used more dramatic lighting.</td>', 'Has a snapshot quality. Needed something to make it more dramatic - maybe you could have used the paints more expressively, or used more dramatic lighting.', '2006-12-28 10:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
