(3155795, 441891, 46314, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but I think your decision to selectively highlight it detracts a bit from it. I think the bright purples of the lavender (I think?) might have added to the flowery nature of the shot.</td>', 'I like the shot, but I think your decision to selectively highlight it detracts a bit from it. I think the bright purples of the lavender (I think?) might have added to the flowery nature of the shot.', '2006-12-28 10:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
