(3155923, 442293, 11854, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a fun job! Nice image, great colors! 8</td>', 'Wow, what a fun job! Nice image, great colors! 8', '2006-12-28 11:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3155925, 441675, 46314, '<td valign="top">So that''s where my mail went... ;-)</td>', 'So that''s where my mail went... ;-)', '2006-12-28 11:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3155927, 442129, 11854, '<td valign="top">Don''t you mean ribbon winning photographer?</td>', 'Don''t you mean ribbon winning photographer?', '2006-12-28 11:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3155929, 441087, 11854, '<td valign="top">Ummm, you work for Star Command? Cute.</td>', 'Ummm, you work for Star Command? Cute.', '2006-12-28 11:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3155931, 441705, 11854, '<td valign="top">Is the red spot blood dripping out of your eyes? LOL.</td>', 'Is the red spot blood dripping out of your eyes? LOL.', '2006-12-28 11:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3155934, 442010, 11854, '<td valign="top">Another painful profession! Best of luck on your next fight.</td>', 'Another painful profession! Best of luck on your next fight.', '2006-12-28 11:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3155935, 442279, 46314, '<td valign="top">Looks like they really swamp you under...</td>', 'Looks like they really swamp you under...', '2006-12-28 11:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3155939, 442260, 11854, '<td valign="top">Grandma, what big eyes you have! ;P Nice macro, nice selective desat., great color! 8</td>', 'Grandma, what big eyes you have! ;P Nice macro, nice selective desat., great color! 8', '2006-12-28 11:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3155940, 442264, 11854, '<td valign="top">It''s not a job, it''s an adventure!</td>', 'It''s not a job, it''s an adventure!', '2006-12-28 11:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3155945, 441276, 11854, '<td valign="top">I don''t envy you your job! At least it''s not Stephen King! LOL.</td>', 'I don''t envy you your job! At least it''s not Stephen King! LOL.', '2006-12-28 11:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156055, 441358, 32754, '<td valign="top">Is that yours, Shez?  This is a wonderfully flowing and visually exciting image..I love the tones and curves of the agave; one of your best and one of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'Is that yours, Shez?  This is a wonderfully flowing and visually exciting image..I love the tones and curves of the agave; one of your best and one of the best in this challenge.', '2006-12-28 12:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156065, 440765, 32754, '<td valign="top">This is a very arresting image...the lack of color and position of truck give it a great impact.</td>', 'This is a very arresting image...the lack of color and position of truck give it a great impact.', '2006-12-28 12:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156070, 441713, 32754, '<td valign="top">There is something eerie and yet attractive about this image..I''m not sure if it''s the tones or the symmetry, but I like it a lot.</td>', 'There is something eerie and yet attractive about this image..I''m not sure if it''s the tones or the symmetry, but I like it a lot.', '2006-12-28 12:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156085, 441828, 32754, '<td valign="top">This is very well done...I like the position of the gloves on the ropes providing a shot of color and acting as a frame for the face; also I like the whole compositional tone and feel.</td>', 'This is very well done...I like the position of the gloves on the ropes providing a shot of color and acting as a frame for the face; also I like the whole compositional tone and feel.', '2006-12-28 12:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156087, 441787, 32754, '<td valign="top">Nice graphic feel and composition..good tones, too.</td>', 'Nice graphic feel and composition..good tones, too.', '2006-12-28 12:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156128, 441358, 5112, '<td valign="top">OK image, but doesn''t convey what you do or your job.  Also, way too recognizeable.  ~2</td>', 'OK image, but doesn''t convey what you do or your job.  Also, way too recognizeable.  ~2', '2006-12-28 12:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156132, 441705, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very good entry.  ~9</td>', 'Very good entry.  ~9', '2006-12-28 12:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156134, 442177, 5112, '<td valign="top">Excellent entry for the challenge.  ~8</td>', 'Excellent entry for the challenge.  ~8', '2006-12-28 12:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156138, 441577, 5112, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  My favourite of the challenge, both a nicely crafted image and a great fit for the topic.  ~10</td>', 'Excellent!  My favourite of the challenge, both a nicely crafted image and a great fit for the topic.  ~10', '2006-12-28 12:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156149, 442264, 5112, '<td valign="top">Took me a moment.  In the military?  I like the "hint" of the American flag, without it the closeup would be quite meaningless, as it is, it gives the necessary context.  ~7</td>', 'Took me a moment.  In the military?  I like the "hint" of the American flag, without it the closeup would be quite meaningless, as it is, it gives the necessary context.  ~7', '2006-12-28 12:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156153, 440591, 5112, '<td valign="top">I love the image, and it is a good fit for the challenge; the border, however, is not too good, especially because it is so uneven (three different widths in the black).  ~8 (higher without the border :) )</td>', 'I love the image, and it is a good fit for the challenge; the border, however, is not too good, especially because it is so uneven (three different widths in the black).  ~8 (higher without the border :) )', '2006-12-28 12:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156397, 441221, 62308, '<td valign="top">I love this! It is very creative.</td>', 'I love this! It is very creative.', '2006-12-28 14:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156487, 442215, 47316, '<td valign="top">I like the editing. It might be nice a little less desaturated or something.</td>', 'I like the editing. It might be nice a little less desaturated or something.', '2006-12-28 14:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156492, 442010, 47316, '<td valign="top">The editing really weakens this shot. The skin has sort of a metalic look that''s very unnatural especially in the face. I think some more show of movement might have helped the shot.</td>', 'The editing really weakens this shot. The skin has sort of a metalic look that''s very unnatural especially in the face. I think some more show of movement might have helped the shot.', '2006-12-28 14:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156496, 442232, 47316, '<td valign="top">Oh my! What can be said about this photograph... well. I bet you are certainly getting a reaction from it! Technically there is so much going on I wouldn''t even know where to start!</td>', 'Oh my! What can be said about this photograph... well. I bet you are certainly getting a reaction from it! Technically there is so much going on I wouldn''t even know where to start!', '2006-12-28 14:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156499, 442001, 47316, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. Wish you could see the camera a little more... if that''s what that is. I think I see a tripod?</td>', 'Very beautiful. Wish you could see the camera a little more... if that''s what that is. I think I see a tripod?', '2006-12-28 15:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156501, 440591, 47316, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and range. The border is rather uneven and that''s a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice contrast and range. The border is rather uneven and that''s a bit distracting.', '2006-12-28 15:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156508, 441828, 47316, '<td valign="top">I like this. Simple composition, strong facial expression. Only thing I''d say is that this cold benefit from some harsher shadows on the face if you wanted to go for a different feel.</td>', 'I like this. Simple composition, strong facial expression. Only thing I''d say is that this cold benefit from some harsher shadows on the face if you wanted to go for a different feel.', '2006-12-28 15:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156609, 440969, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement and expression.  I''d like to see more detail, please use the full 640 pixels for the major dimension - please see Tutorial "Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges."  Also try off-camera lighting with a diffuser.</td>', 'Nice arrangement and expression.  I''d like to see more detail, please use the full 640 pixels for the major dimension - please see Tutorial "Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges."  Also try off-camera lighting with a diffuser.', '2006-12-28 15:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156623, 442160, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice juxtaposition.  Consider re/moving camera strap and adjusting white balance and less-blue/more-natural skin tone.</td>', 'Nice juxtaposition.  Consider re/moving camera strap and adjusting white balance and less-blue/more-natural skin tone.', '2006-12-28 15:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156642, 440634, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice house.  But as a landscaper(?), I''m fairly certain that you should be able to find some nice looking shrubbery even in winter.  Would also be better without the timestamp.</td>', 'Nice house.  But as a landscaper(?), I''m fairly certain that you should be able to find some nice looking shrubbery even in winter.  Would also be better without the timestamp.', '2006-12-28 15:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156654, 441138, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Consider fewer selected items and arrangement for a colors, and softer lighting would help a lot.  Light shining through colored liquid cleaners like Windex could be a big win.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Consider fewer selected items and arrangement for a colors, and softer lighting would help a lot.  Light shining through colored liquid cleaners like Windex could be a big win.', '2006-12-28 15:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156659, 442184, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and composition.  More exposure and lighting would help.</td>', 'Nice pose and composition.  More exposure and lighting would help.', '2006-12-28 15:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156672, 442231, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colorful smoke(?) - simpler would be better, perhaps just crop one or two of the major patterns.</td>', 'Nice colorful smoke(?) - simpler would be better, perhaps just crop one or two of the major patterns.', '2006-12-28 15:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156689, 441398, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and expression.  Given the occupation, why not use a church sanctuary?  A background of stained glass would be both fitting and beautiful, and candles would be better than cordwood.</td>', 'Nice pose and expression.  Given the occupation, why not use a church sanctuary?  A background of stained glass would be both fitting and beautiful, and candles would be better than cordwood.', '2006-12-28 16:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156711, 441653, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement.  More DOF and a tighter crop with less paper and out-of-focus foreground would be better.</td>', 'Nice arrangement.  More DOF and a tighter crop with less paper and out-of-focus foreground would be better.', '2006-12-28 16:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156769, 442232, 44490, '<td valign="top">Too funny!  Good expression, pose, arrangement.  Good illumination on subject (especially face) and tighter crop would be better.</td>', 'Too funny!  Good expression, pose, arrangement.  Good illumination on subject (especially face) and tighter crop would be better.', '2006-12-28 16:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156776, 442311, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nicely sharp and colorful, but I''m confused.  What is it, and what''s your occupation?  It might help some of us if you spelled it out more clearly in your title.</td>', 'Nicely sharp and colorful, but I''m confused.  What is it, and what''s your occupation?  It might help some of us if you spelled it out more clearly in your title.', '2006-12-28 16:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156785, 440229, 70521, '<td valign="top">hilarious shot.  love the idea!  I''m sure some people will find problems with the exposure on his face, but kudos on the creativity and the execution!  Cheers</td>', 'hilarious shot.  love the idea!  I''m sure some people will find problems with the exposure on his face, but kudos on the creativity and the execution!  Cheers', '2006-12-28 16:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156788, 441251, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice group shot.  But with this crew, I''d wish for an action shot with a good expression on at least one face, maybe with the others cheering them on -- capturing the shot would be a challenge, but I think that would really win.</td>', 'Nice group shot.  But with this crew, I''d wish for an action shot with a good expression on at least one face, maybe with the others cheering them on -- capturing the shot would be a challenge, but I think that would really win.', '2006-12-28 16:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156791, 442177, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice pose.  Wish for more eyes, both yours and the horse''s.</td>', 'Nice pose.  Wish for more eyes, both yours and the horse''s.', '2006-12-28 16:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156818, 441675, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, focus and DOF on worker is good, but the minimal profile just doesn''t provide enough visibly sharp subject - more face would be better.</td>', 'Nice colors, focus and DOF on worker is good, but the minimal profile just doesn''t provide enough visibly sharp subject - more face would be better.', '2006-12-28 16:48:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3156904, 441811, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, expression, and arrangement of elements including toothbrush and floss pick behind ear.  Off-camera key light with diffuser would help.</td>', 'Nice pose, expression, and arrangement of elements including toothbrush and floss pick behind ear.  Off-camera key light with diffuser would help.', '2006-12-28 17:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156906, 442293, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement of rod and reel, nice colors, especially green line.  Wish for some prettier lures/flies.</td>', 'Nice arrangement of rod and reel, nice colors, especially green line.  Wish for some prettier lures/flies.', '2006-12-28 17:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156937, 442330, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, interesting hands and lighting.  Might be better with a little DOF and distance separation from the blanket for less distraction and more focus on the hands.</td>', 'Nice idea, interesting hands and lighting.  Might be better with a little DOF and distance separation from the blanket for less distraction and more focus on the hands.', '2006-12-28 17:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156940, 441828, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good portrait, clarity, sweat, color.  Just seems overly dark, would be better with brighter levels.</td>', 'Good portrait, clarity, sweat, color.  Just seems overly dark, would be better with brighter levels.', '2006-12-28 17:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156941, 442172, 44490, '<td valign="top">Cute, humorous, and studious, good arrangement, lighting, and curious expression, even the clutter work.  Love it.</td>', 'Cute, humorous, and studious, good arrangement, lighting, and curious expression, even the clutter work.  Love it.', '2006-12-28 17:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156943, 440985, 44490, '<td valign="top">Scary and effective perspective, cool shot, and nice illumination on the driver.</td>', 'Scary and effective perspective, cool shot, and nice illumination on the driver.', '2006-12-28 17:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156949, 441223, 44490, '<td valign="top">Hahaha!  Just too funny - good humor, pose, little helper with TP, and ingeneous use of hand drier.</td>', 'Hahaha!  Just too funny - good humor, pose, little helper with TP, and ingeneous use of hand drier.', '2006-12-28 17:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156950, 441620, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good idea, and striking image.  I think that a less oblong and tighter crop would give you more pixels to better show off the great reflection.</td>', 'Good idea, and striking image.  I think that a less oblong and tighter crop would give you more pixels to better show off the great reflection.', '2006-12-28 17:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156951, 442223, 44490, '<td valign="top">Hope it pays more than a hill of beans!  Good idea and execution, interesting pose and lighting.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Hope it pays more than a hill of beans!  Good idea and execution, interesting pose and lighting.  Nicely done.', '2006-12-28 17:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156952, 441244, 44490, '<td valign="top">What a delightful and fun mother/daughter photo!  The expressions, colors, and lighting are great.  Love it.</td>', 'What a delightful and fun mother/daughter photo!  The expressions, colors, and lighting are great.  Love it.', '2006-12-28 17:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156997, 441577, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, good composition.</td>', 'Nice idea, good composition.', '2006-12-28 17:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157006, 440838, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, curves, converging lines, lights, colors, rippled reflection, person.  Love it and hope that it does well.</td>', 'Interesting photo, curves, converging lines, lights, colors, rippled reflection, person.  Love it and hope that it does well.', '2006-12-28 17:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157019, 440765, 44490, '<td valign="top">This image feels like trucking, good perspective, composition, simple and effective.  Illumination of the drive might help, but I like it a lot.  Keep on truckin''!</td>', 'This image feels like trucking, good perspective, composition, simple and effective.  Illumination of the drive might help, but I like it a lot.  Keep on truckin''!', '2006-12-28 17:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157031, 442330, 70567, '<td valign="top">I am in awe of this photo.  It stirs such emotions in me.  Emotions of warmth, kidness, of humanity.  To me, it stands out from all the rest.</td>', 'I am in awe of this photo.  It stirs such emotions in me.  Emotions of warmth, kidness, of humanity.  To me, it stands out from all the rest.', '2006-12-28 18:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157078, 442232, 51269, '<td valign="top">this is so fnny it deserves a ten !</td>', 'this is so fnny it deserves a ten !', '2006-12-28 18:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157086, 441007, 51269, '<td valign="top">it''s obvious what you do &amp; so well-10</td>', 'it''s obvious what you do & so well-10', '2006-12-28 18:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157089, 441875, 32338, '<td valign="top">I feel pain..</td>', 'I feel pain..', '2006-12-28 18:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157092, 441577, 32338, '<td valign="top">Cute, very cute</td>', 'Cute, very cute', '2006-12-28 18:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157094, 442019, 32338, '<td valign="top">..You are kidding... (sheeping?)</td>', '..You are kidding... (sheeping?)', '2006-12-28 18:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157097, 441484, 32338, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Neat expression and fun lighting.</td>', 'I really like this.  Neat expression and fun lighting.', '2006-12-28 18:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157101, 442160, 32338, '<td valign="top">The dryer as a background - interesting.</td>', 'The dryer as a background - interesting.', '2006-12-28 18:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157104, 441244, 32338, '<td valign="top">The split subject matter is very interesting here.</td>', 'The split subject matter is very interesting here.', '2006-12-28 18:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157111, 441223, 32338, '<td valign="top">Too funny.</td>', 'Too funny.', '2006-12-28 18:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157115, 441713, 32338, '<td valign="top">Great image of a tough subject.</td>', 'Great image of a tough subject.', '2006-12-28 18:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157121, 441398, 32338, '<td valign="top">This is a funny image.</td>', 'This is a funny image.', '2006-12-28 18:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157132, 442245, 32338, '<td valign="top">Interesting macro.  If you do this again, it may be good to try for greater DOF that would include the foreground.  I really like the texture of the metal and the thread.</td>', 'Interesting macro.  If you do this again, it may be good to try for greater DOF that would include the foreground.  I really like the texture of the metal and the thread.', '2006-12-28 18:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157133, 442330, 32338, '<td valign="top">Touching image.</td>', 'Touching image.', '2006-12-28 18:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157146, 442232, 32338, '<td valign="top">Yikes - I hope you have another ''costume''.</td>', 'Yikes - I hope you have another ''costume''.', '2006-12-28 18:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157153, 440765, 32338, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - it feels like the truck is in motion.</td>', 'Nice composition - it feels like the truck is in motion.', '2006-12-28 18:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157158, 442293, 32338, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  It would make a good Father''s Day card front.</td>', 'Nice image.  It would make a good Father''s Day card front.', '2006-12-28 18:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157160, 441828, 32338, '<td valign="top">Wow - great color and texture</td>', 'Wow - great color and texture', '2006-12-28 18:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157162, 441734, 32338, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image</td>', 'Beautiful image', '2006-12-28 18:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157222, 441397, 55838, '<td valign="top">Oh that poor little kiddo - that little face filled with trepidation (don''t worry little cutie - she looks sweet and gentle)!  Love the composition and the b&amp;w - great lighting too.  Back to bump you up to 8.  Well done. ******  On second thought kid RUN!!!  It looks like she''s packin'' a pistol!</td>', 'Oh that poor little kiddo - that little face filled with trepidation (don''t worry little cutie - she looks sweet and gentle)!  Love the composition and the b&w - great lighting too.  Back to bump you up to 8.  Well done. ******  On second thought kid RUN!!!  It looks like she''s packin'' a pistol!', '2006-12-28 19:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157268, 442223, 66597, '<td valign="top">LOL. Very creative!</td>', 'LOL. Very creative!', '2006-12-28 19:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157270, 442232, 66597, '<td valign="top">LOL. This is pretty funny. Love all the textures and patterns, really adds to the feeling of chaos here. Oh, and nice camisole. :-)</td>', 'LOL. This is pretty funny. Love all the textures and patterns, really adds to the feeling of chaos here. Oh, and nice camisole. :-)', '2006-12-28 19:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157271, 442140, 66597, '<td valign="top">Could be better technically (i.e. hand not cut off on top, softer lighting) but the expression is priceless. 6.</td>', 'Could be better technically (i.e. hand not cut off on top, softer lighting) but the expression is priceless. 6.', '2006-12-28 19:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157272, 441484, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting on the face.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting on the face.', '2006-12-28 19:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157273, 442184, 66597, '<td valign="top">Has almost a goth look. Very stylized, great dodging and/or lighting to subtly bring out expression.</td>', 'Has almost a goth look. Very stylized, great dodging and/or lighting to subtly bring out expression.', '2006-12-28 19:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157274, 441577, 66597, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and lighting. Bump for creativity.</td>', 'Excellent composition and lighting. Bump for creativity.', '2006-12-28 19:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157276, 442001, 66597, '<td valign="top">The milky quality of the water is fantastic. Great long exposure shot. Sky looks a little too blown to match the softness of the falls, though. 7.</td>', 'The milky quality of the water is fantastic. Great long exposure shot. Sky looks a little too blown to match the softness of the falls, though. 7.', '2006-12-28 19:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157278, 441221, 66597, '<td valign="top">Wow. This blows me away. Wonderful creativity and composition, just the right amount of sharpness. Hope this one ribbons. 10.</td>', 'Wow. This blows me away. Wonderful creativity and composition, just the right amount of sharpness. Hope this one ribbons. 10.', '2006-12-28 19:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157280, 440634, 66597, '<td valign="top">Just an FYI for future challenges, you can''t have any writing (including dates) or you can get DQ''d.</td>', 'Just an FYI for future challenges, you can''t have any writing (including dates) or you can get DQ''d.', '2006-12-28 19:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157283, 441828, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and composition. The lighting is so good here, as is the sweat. 9.</td>', 'I love the colors and composition. The lighting is so good here, as is the sweat. 9.', '2006-12-28 19:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157288, 442260, 66597, '<td valign="top">The selective desat is beautiful, as are the details in the iris. The two blown highlights are distracting, though, and it looks like there is an odd row of lashes below the real lashes partially covering the iris. Don''t know if this is intentional, but it looks a bit like cloning.</td>', 'The selective desat is beautiful, as are the details in the iris. The two blown highlights are distracting, though, and it looks like there is an odd row of lashes below the real lashes partially covering the iris. Don''t know if this is intentional, but it looks a bit like cloning.', '2006-12-28 20:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157292, 442231, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful abstract. The composition and movement are just wonderful. 10.</td>', 'This is a beautiful abstract. The composition and movement are just wonderful. 10.', '2006-12-28 20:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
