(3163818, 441211, 66515, '<td valign="top">A lot darker than what I usually like. I think a different crop may have helped here. (e.g. the head and the monitor perhaps?)</td>', 'A lot darker than what I usually like. I think a different crop may have helped here. (e.g. the head and the monitor perhaps?)', '2006-12-31 02:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
