(3163830, 442320, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Hard to execute. There needs to be a little different focus. (Either more of the cable in focus or the close ones in focus with the ones further away out of focus).</td>', 'Nice idea. Hard to execute. There needs to be a little different focus. (Either more of the cable in focus or the close ones in focus with the ones further away out of focus).', '2006-12-31 02:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
