(3163832, 441708, 66515, '<td valign="top">Not really getting a good feel for what you do. I imagine you deal with animals but I don''t see what they are.</td>', 'Not really getting a good feel for what you do. I imagine you deal with animals but I don''t see what they are.', '2006-12-31 02:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
