(3164325, 441828, 66348, '<td valign="top">Dude somehow we got chemistry with our shots, or great minds think alike, whatever the case our first shot of James Bond in Casino Royale was the same, and now we are both boxers and took shots of it. Except yours is a hell of a lot better. Nice work man. Great clarity and color in the gloves, and the use of negative space is great work. Well done again. 10!! What class our you in, in the International Federation?</td>', 'Dude somehow we got chemistry with our shots, or great minds think alike, whatever the case our first shot of James Bond in Casino Royale was the same, and now we are both boxers and took shots of it. Except yours is a hell of a lot better. Nice work man. Great clarity and color in the gloves, and the use of negative space is great work. Well done again. 10!! What class our you in, in the International Federation?', '2006-12-31 13:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
