(3164944, 442269, 61413, '<td valign="top">a lovely time of day.<br/> <br/>It''s a shame there''s a bit of burnout in the clouds. I would have tried to bring out a little more colour in the grass and foliage; though there''s always a strong yellow component to the colouring at this time of day, which makes it difficult.<br/> <br/>nicely composed, though.</td>', 'a lovely time of day. It''s a shame there''s a bit of burnout in the clouds. I would have tried to bring out a little more colour in the grass and foliage; though there''s always a strong yellow component to the colouring at this time of day, which makes it difficult. nicely composed, though.', '2006-12-31 18:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
