(3165009, 442270, 61413, '<td valign="top">The moonlight sonata, by moonlight, no less! I suspect it''s actually daylight, but the effect is convincing.<br/> <br/>I like the positioning of the subject, with effective use of empty space at the top.</td>', 'The moonlight sonata, by moonlight, no less! I suspect it''s actually daylight, but the effect is convincing. I like the positioning of the subject, with effective use of empty space at the top.', '2006-12-31 19:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
