(3165023, 441223, 61413, '<td valign="top">Very funny. Been there, done that!</td>', 'Very funny. Been there, done that!', '2006-12-31 19:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165026, 441700, 61413, '<td valign="top">a nice idea, well executed. I wonder if you could have gone a little more wide-angle, and closer to the ball?</td>', 'a nice idea, well executed. I wonder if you could have gone a little more wide-angle, and closer to the ball?', '2006-12-31 19:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165030, 441749, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice idea; well composed. The lighting of the x-ray itself works well, but (a <i>very</i> small point) it''s a shame it spills out into lighting the human subject as well.</td>', 'Nice idea; well composed. The lighting of the x-ray itself works well, but (a very small point) it''s a shame it spills out into lighting the human subject as well.', '2006-12-31 19:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165032, 441685, 61413, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. Nice backlighting.<br/> <br/>I wonder whether having the red-green boundary run down the middle of the face would have worked better, or if it would have been too symmetrical. also, maybe having the central red &amp; green stripes running directly over the eyes.</td>', 'Interesting concept. Nice backlighting. I wonder whether having the red-green boundary run down the middle of the face would have worked better, or if it would have been too symmetrical. also, maybe having the central red & green stripes running directly over the eyes.', '2006-12-31 19:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165037, 442245, 61413, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot, this. Juxtaposing the warmth of the fabric with the metallic detail of the sewing machine.<br/> <br/>Good idea, well executed.</td>', 'A beautiful shot, this. Juxtaposing the warmth of the fabric with the metallic detail of the sewing machine. Good idea, well executed.', '2006-12-31 19:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
