(3165059, 441484, 61413, '<td valign="top">A well executed portrait - lighting, framing, etc all done well.<br/> <br/>I''d have scored it more highly if there was a bit of actual cheffing going on, though.</td>', 'A well executed portrait - lighting, framing, etc all done well. I''d have scored it more highly if there was a bit of actual cheffing going on, though.', '2006-12-31 19:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165066, 441442, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, well composed and executed.<br/> <br/>The strong backlight draws my eyes away from the scissors a little, though. Did you think about maybe putting some stronger lighting on the scissors?</td>', 'Nice idea, well composed and executed. The strong backlight draws my eyes away from the scissors a little, though. Did you think about maybe putting some stronger lighting on the scissors?', '2006-12-31 19:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165079, 442279, 61413, '<td valign="top">Very funny.<br/> <br/>The background is maybe a bit too cluttered for this to be a truly great shot, though. Maybe a narrower DOF, keeping the human subject in focus but de-emphasising the detail in the cubicles further away, might have worked better.<br/> <br/>Lighting''s a bit flat, too. But I don''t suppose there was much you could to about that without using some expensive external flashes.</td>', 'Very funny. The background is maybe a bit too cluttered for this to be a truly great shot, though. Maybe a narrower DOF, keeping the human subject in focus but de-emphasising the detail in the cubicles further away, might have worked better. Lighting''s a bit flat, too. But I don''t suppose there was much you could to about that without using some expensive external flashes.', '2006-12-31 19:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165090, 442001, 61413, '<td valign="top">I''m always a sucker for these slow-shutter water pics. This is a good example of the genre, although the sky has been treated a little harshly.<br/> <br/>Borderline dnmc, though - sticking a photographer in the frame doesn''t make it a photo <i>about</i> the photographer. And this one strikes me as being very much about the water...</td>', 'I''m always a sucker for these slow-shutter water pics. This is a good example of the genre, although the sky has been treated a little harshly. Borderline dnmc, though - sticking a photographer in the frame doesn''t make it a photo about the photographer. And this one strikes me as being very much about the water...', '2006-12-31 19:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165093, 442223, 61413, '<td valign="top">Very funny. I think the title would have worked better without stating the bleedin'' obvious and spelling out the joke for everyone, though.<br/> <br/>Nicely composed. Good use of light, colour and perspective. 8</td>', 'Very funny. I think the title would have worked better without stating the bleedin'' obvious and spelling out the joke for everyone, though. Nicely composed. Good use of light, colour and perspective. 8', '2006-12-31 19:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165094, 441620, 61413, '<td valign="top">Effective use of light and dark. Creates a real sense of concentration.</td>', 'Effective use of light and dark. Creates a real sense of concentration.', '2006-12-31 19:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165100, 440838, 61413, '<td valign="top">Good use of colour and light.<br/> <br/>I wonder whether a slightly narrower DOF would have enhanced the sense of perspective. Maybe have the bed go slightly out of focus as it proceeds into the foreground.</td>', 'Good use of colour and light. I wonder whether a slightly narrower DOF would have enhanced the sense of perspective. Maybe have the bed go slightly out of focus as it proceeds into the foreground.', '2006-12-31 19:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165101, 441891, 61413, '<td valign="top">dnmc</td>', 'dnmc', '2006-12-31 19:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165106, 442184, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice moody shot. But the lighting needs a bit of work, to break up the uniform greyness of the shot and provide a bit of contrast.</td>', 'Nice moody shot. But the lighting needs a bit of work, to break up the uniform greyness of the shot and provide a bit of contrast.', '2006-12-31 19:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165110, 440229, 61413, '<td valign="top">dnmc</td>', 'dnmc', '2006-12-31 19:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165113, 441883, 61413, '<td valign="top">Very funny. Lovely expression. Not sure it needed to be so dark, though.</td>', 'Very funny. Lovely expression. Not sure it needed to be so dark, though.', '2006-12-31 19:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165119, 441219, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hey, Judy, girl, you look like you''re having loads of fun!  Not!!!  Lovely shot, I like the grain.</td>', 'Hey, Judy, girl, you look like you''re having loads of fun!  Not!!!  Lovely shot, I like the grain.', '2006-12-31 20:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165121, 440765, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I think the position of the truck in the frame is just right, but the empty space to the left is just a little too overpowering somehow. If there had been something in there it would have worked better. Something small to emphasise the size of the truck - a roadsign, perhaps?</td>', 'Nice shot. I think the position of the truck in the frame is just right, but the empty space to the left is just a little too overpowering somehow. If there had been something in there it would have worked better. Something small to emphasise the size of the truck - a roadsign, perhaps?', '2006-12-31 20:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165131, 442123, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2006-12-31 20:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165134, 441007, 61413, '<td valign="top">The reflection of the cat looks like it''s been edited a little harshly. but it''s neet the way the cat is looking into the lens via the reflection, rather than directly.</td>', 'The reflection of the cat looks like it''s been edited a little harshly. but it''s neet the way the cat is looking into the lens via the reflection, rather than directly.', '2006-12-31 20:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165141, 441734, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice theme. good composition. Lighting a little flat. Lovely expressions, though. And DOF works well.</td>', 'Nice theme. good composition. Lighting a little flat. Lovely expressions, though. And DOF works well.', '2006-12-31 20:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
