(3165200, 441358, 61413, '<td valign="top">I have a few of these in my garden, but mine have all been got at by insects :-( Generally, the shape of them is very photogenic, I think.<br/> <br/>I think the blue has been a bit overdone, though. and borderline dnmc, IMO.</td>', 'I have a few of these in my garden, but mine have all been got at by insects :-( Generally, the shape of them is very photogenic, I think. I think the blue has been a bit overdone, though. and borderline dnmc, IMO.', '2006-12-31 20:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165206, 442240, 61413, '<td valign="top">Works well as a monochrome shot, especially with the lighting.</td>', 'Works well as a monochrome shot, especially with the lighting.', '2006-12-31 20:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165208, 439968, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. shame about the over-exposure right where the eye is drawn, though.</td>', 'Nice shot. shame about the over-exposure right where the eye is drawn, though.', '2006-12-31 20:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
