(3165495, 441875, 29904, '<td valign="top">Very nice textures and compostion, nicely executed idea to portray a not so visually interesting occupation.  A little hot above the eyebrow.</td>', 'Very nice textures and compostion, nicely executed idea to portray a not so visually interesting occupation.  A little hot above the eyebrow.', '2006-12-31 22:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165498, 441358, 29904, '<td valign="top">Very lovly composition, color, clarity, and contrast!</td>', 'Very lovly composition, color, clarity, and contrast!', '2006-12-31 22:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165501, 442223, 29904, '<td valign="top">Great idea, excellent execution!</td>', 'Great idea, excellent execution!', '2006-12-31 22:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165506, 441007, 29904, '<td valign="top">Love those green eyes looking at the camera via the mirror!</td>', 'Love those green eyes looking at the camera via the mirror!', '2006-12-31 22:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165511, 442245, 29904, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, perfect clarity and dof</td>', 'Very nicely done, perfect clarity and dof', '2006-12-31 22:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165524, 441221, 29904, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and execution.   I think I would prefer it cropped tighter only.</td>', 'Excellent idea and execution.   I think I would prefer it cropped tighter only.', '2006-12-31 22:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165529, 441685, 29904, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and execution!  Just needs a little more sharpness, I think.</td>', 'Excellent idea and execution!  Just needs a little more sharpness, I think.', '2006-12-31 22:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165533, 440838, 29904, '<td valign="top">This is a really great set-up.  Great color and lighting.  Only wish the top was cropped some and you were much clearer.</td>', 'This is a really great set-up.  Great color and lighting.  Only wish the top was cropped some and you were much clearer.', '2006-12-31 22:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165541, 440634, 29904, '<td valign="top">Date stamping is very unatractive and I thought not allowed.  The picture is rather blah, too much dead twigs and the house is chopped off at the top.  Either include all or none of it.  This is a tough one to portray in the winter when most is dead.  Not meaning to be harsh, and hope that helps, please keep at it!</td>', 'Date stamping is very unatractive and I thought not allowed.  The picture is rather blah, too much dead twigs and the house is chopped off at the top.  Either include all or none of it.  This is a tough one to portray in the winter when most is dead.  Not meaning to be harsh, and hope that helps, please keep at it!', '2006-12-31 23:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165554, 442232, 26206, '<td valign="top">omg this is hilarious.. i pray that my husband doesn''t dress like this on weekend days when i''m at work and he''s home with the house and kid!</td>', 'omg this is hilarious.. i pray that my husband doesn''t dress like this on weekend days when i''m at work and he''s home with the house and kid!', '2006-12-31 23:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165555, 442308, 63244, '<td valign="top">I like this!  Good bokeh.  Adorable model.</td>', 'I like this!  Good bokeh.  Adorable model.', '2006-12-31 23:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165564, 440073, 63244, '<td valign="top">Nice pic.  Perhaps a more uniform crop to make the dark space above blue and below pink more uniform? This would draw the attention more to the colors and not so much dark space. (just my two cents).  Pleasing photo.</td>', 'Nice pic.  Perhaps a more uniform crop to make the dark space above blue and below pink more uniform? This would draw the attention more to the colors and not so much dark space. (just my two cents).  Pleasing photo.', '2006-12-31 23:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165580, 439925, 67841, '<td valign="top">Hey, I have that head! (well, 2 actually...) and I have the 503 which I like a lot more.  I also have a Cartoni, which cost more than it''s worth, IMHO but the carbon fiber legs make up for the less than stellar head...  Kudos for putting a decent lens on that XL2, I have the original XL1 which still gets used!  Not much though since I have an HVX-200 at work...<br/> <br/>Good luck - came back to add more to my comment &amp; bump you up a notch.  Criticisms:  I would have used more diffusion on your key to soften the shadows &amp; flagged/scrimmed off the area hitting the white of the camera to help bring some detail back there.  A back light would have been great to add a little bit of modeling to all that black plastic.  Believe it or not, I actually think the red velvet is hurting you quite a bit here, but that''s probably my own personal taste...  To me the worst is the hard shadows.<br/> <br/>Good luck - you''ll probably beat my entry which ended up being a last minute snap-shot (after abandoning my other shot which took almost 2 hours to light &amp; set-up - lol).<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-01 02:28:19.</i></td>', 'Hey, I have that head! (well, 2 actually...) and I have the 503 which I like a lot more.  I also have a Cartoni, which cost more than it''s worth, IMHO but the carbon fiber legs make up for the less than stellar head...  Kudos for putting a decent lens on that XL2, I have the original XL1 which still gets used!  Not much though since I have an HVX-200 at work... Good luck - came back to add more to my comment & bump you up a notch.  Criticisms:  I would have used more diffusion on your key to soften the shadows & flagged/scrimmed off the area hitting the white of the camera to help bring some detail back there.  A back light would have been great to add a little bit of modeling to all that black plastic.  Believe it or not, I actually think the red velvet is hurting you quite a bit here, but that''s probably my own personal taste...  To me the worst is the hard shadows. Good luck - you''ll probably beat my entry which ended up being a last minute snap-shot (after abandoning my other shot which took almost 2 hours to light & set-up - lol).', '2006-12-31 23:23:03.000000', '2007-01-01 02:28:19.000000', 1),
(3165586, 440838, 63244, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea.  Color is interesting as is the angle. Perhaps a tighter crop on the top. 8</td>', 'Excellent idea.  Color is interesting as is the angle. Perhaps a tighter crop on the top. 8', '2006-12-31 23:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165591, 441828, 63244, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  Nice coloring and crop.</td>', 'Excellent photo.  Nice coloring and crop.', '2006-12-31 23:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
