(3165606, 441653, 63244, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit tighter crop on the bottom for the out of focus area.  I like the composition and the color.  The border works well.  Nice photograph.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit tighter crop on the bottom for the out of focus area.  I like the composition and the color.  The border works well.  Nice photograph.', '2006-12-31 23:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
