(3166310, 442160, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here. This image is interesting to me, and I spent a lot of time looking at it. I think the clothes, or whatever is hanging down at the top is a bit distracting and breaks up the nice line of the dryer circling your head. That''s quite a halo you have created for yourself; you deserve to have it in tact. ;)</td>', 'I like the colors here. This image is interesting to me, and I spent a lot of time looking at it. I think the clothes, or whatever is hanging down at the top is a bit distracting and breaks up the nice line of the dryer circling your head. That''s quite a halo you have created for yourself; you deserve to have it in tact. ;)', '2007-01-01 02:32:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3166311, 442330, 18450, '<td valign="top">Superb, powerful emotive work!</td>', 'Superb, powerful emotive work!', '2007-01-01 02:33:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3166315, 441577, 60862, '<td valign="top">This is terrific!  I''m so happy it did so well. :)</td>', 'This is terrific!  I''m so happy it did so well. :)', '2007-01-01 02:35:15.000000', NULL, 0),
