(3166406, 442092, 53316, '<td valign="top">I would have prefered maybe having a loser crop on the top as well as (and I know you can''t really control this) having the dress be a bit more snug.  I love the lighting, pose, expression.. and somehow it looks very soft but still in focus at the same time, which is really, really awesome.</td>', 'I would have prefered maybe having a loser crop on the top as well as (and I know you can''t really control this) having the dress be a bit more snug.  I love the lighting, pose, expression.. and somehow it looks very soft but still in focus at the same time, which is really, really awesome.', '2007-01-01 03:55:19.000000', NULL, 0),
