(3166943, 441398, 61155, '<td valign="top">Tell it like it is Brother. There IS too much at stake not to.<br/> <br/>A great shot, which should have been much higher.<br/> <br/>Continue to preach The Word with boldness throughout 2007!!<br/></td>', 'Tell it like it is Brother. There IS too much at stake not to. A great shot, which should have been much higher. Continue to preach The Word with boldness throughout 2007!!', '2007-01-01 08:44:25.000000', NULL, 0),
